/// <summary>Instruction bytes consumed as data by the bounded SpaceTime palette-copy overrun.</summary>
/// <remarks>
/// With direct-page pointer zero, inherited animation Y=$912F enters the signed
/// $90:AD12 loop at $9131. Subsequent animation records start later in this same
/// window. Y advances by two through $FFFF, then wraps into live low WRAM and
/// exits at $0021. Only the immutable portion of that source is defined here;
/// the caller still performs each original copy and retains live mutable reads.
